    "detailed_description": "\u201cMemorize\u201d is a challenge of memory and patience! This challenge to reach the fiftieth (50th) movement will demand the most of your brain. Just try to remember that with every mistake, there is a lesson to be learned...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><br>-<u>Four sides, four options!</u><br>Discover by trial, error and memory which is the correct path! The tension increases with each movement, making it necessary to memorize more and more! An error. All over again...<br><br>-<u>50 moves</u><br>Memorizing just 50 moves seems like an easy task, doesn't it?...<br><br>-<u>Think carefully about every move</u><br>The first steps depend on luck, the others on your memory!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The further away, the harder it gets<br></li><li>When you start the game again, another path will be automatically generated!<br></li><li>Challenging but addictive game<br></li><li>Challenge your friends to master this test of determination<br></li><li>Moments of frustration are waiting</li></ul><br><strong>&quot;Many will say: &quot;Waste of time&quot;; Few will say: &quot;I did it&quot;&quot;.</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "\u201cMemorize\u201d is a challenge of memory and patience! This challenge to reach the fiftieth (50th) movement will demand the most of your brain. Just try to remember that with every mistake, there is a lesson to be learned...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><br>-<u>Four sides, four options!</u><br>Discover by trial, error and memory which is the correct path! The tension increases with each movement, making it necessary to memorize more and more! An error. All over again...<br><br>-<u>50 moves</u><br>Memorizing just 50 moves seems like an easy task, doesn't it?...<br><br>-<u>Think carefully about every move</u><br>The first steps depend on luck, the others on your memory!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The further away, the harder it gets<br></li><li>When you start the game again, another path will be automatically generated!<br></li><li>Challenging but addictive game<br></li><li>Challenge your friends to master this test of determination<br></li><li>Moments of frustration are waiting</li></ul><br><strong>&quot;Many will say: &quot;Waste of time&quot;; Few will say: &quot;I did it&quot;&quot;.</strong>",
    "short_description": "A game of memorizing the path, resetting every time you make a mistake. 50 Moves, can you memorize?",
